# Extra DNS names for the Platform CA leaf, one per line.
# Interface IPv4 addresses and the host FQDN are discovered automatically.
# Copy this file to lan-aliases (gitignored), uncomment the names Add Server
# will dial, then:
#   vagrant provision --provision-with dev-forward-hosts
# Converge afterwards so instance-certs remints the leaf. A name that is
# not on the leaf is refused before an install command is issued.
# dev.lan
